%% title: Sanctions List Refresh Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> REGISTERED : POST /sanctions/lists<br/>{source, url}
  REGISTERED --> FETCHING : POST /lists/{id}/refresh<br/>(or cron 06:00 UTC)
  FETCHING --> VALIDATING : payload downloaded
  FETCHING --> FAILED : network / 4xx-5xx
  VALIDATING --> ACTIVE : schema OK, signed if required
  VALIDATING --> FAILED : signature mismatch
  FAILED --> FETCHING : retry (exp backoff)

  ACTIVE --> FETCHING : next cron / manual refresh
  ACTIVE --> DISABLED : DELETE /lists/{id}<br/>(ops kill-switch)
  DISABLED --> ACTIVE : POST /lists/{id}/enable

  ACTIVE --> [*] : list permanently removed

  note right of ACTIVE
    Only ACTIVE lists are
    consulted by /screen
  end note

  note right of FAILED
    Stale entries kept in
    cache; alert fired to
    compliance ops
  end note
